    "title": "OKC Police seeking 2 women who stole $1K in fragrances from Ulta store - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jacqueline Winchester ,\n7 hours ago OKLAHOMA CITY, OKLA. (KOKH) — Oklahoma City Police are hoping the public can help identify two women who walked out of an Ulta store with over $1,000 in fragrances. It happened at the Ulta near Reno Avenue and MacArthur Boulevard. Police say the women made no attempt to pay before leaving the store. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 12",
